---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: June 8, 2026.</p>
  <p>
    DLPTest.com is a free testing resource. The site is intentionally designed
    to handle as little of your data as possible:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      The HTTP and HTTPS post endpoints accept request bodies and immediately
      discard them. We do not log, store, or forward the contents of those
      submissions.
    </li>
    <li>
      The contact form is delivered by email to the site owner and is not
      retained beyond that.
    </li>
    <li>
      The FTP server stores uploaded files for approximately 10 minutes, after
      which they are deleted.
    </li>
    <li>
      The newsletter signup and the feedback form are optional. Signups are sent
      to our email-list provider; feedback is filed as a public issue in our
      GitHub repository, including any GitHub username you choose to add.
    </li>
    <li>
      Cloudflare, our hosting provider, processes routine HTTP request metadata
      (IP address, user agent, URL, timestamp) on our behalf.
    </li>
    <li>
      We use Google Analytics (via Google Tag Manager) to understand aggregate
      site usage. This sets cookies and shares standard analytics data, such as
      your IP address and the pages you view, with Google. You can block it with
      your browser settings or an ad/tracker blocker.
    </li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
